{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-architecture","title":"可观测性平台架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/observability-platforms/platform-architecture","wordCount":1405,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性平台架构\">可观测性平台架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可观测性平台（Observability Platform）是集中化管理指标、日志和追踪三大遥测数据的技术基础设施，为工程团队提供统一的数据采集、存储、查询和可视化能力。一个成熟的可观测性平台需要处理海量遥测数据的摄入和存储、提供低延迟的查询响应、支持灵活的数据关联分析，同时控制总体拥有成本（TCO）。</p>\n<p>可观测性平台的架构选择通常在两个方向之间权衡：<strong>统一平台</strong>（All-in-One，如 Datadog、New Relic）提供开箱即用的完整体验但成本较高且存在供应商锁定；<strong>组合式平台</strong>（Best-of-Breed，如 Prometheus + Loki + Tempo + Grafana）提供更高的灵活性和成本控制但集成和运维复杂度更高。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 数据采集层&#10;        A[应用SDK] --&gt; D[OTel Collector]&#10;        B[基础设施Agent] --&gt; D&#10;        C[日志采集器] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数据处理层&#10;        D --&gt; E[路由/过滤/采样]&#10;        E --&gt; F[格式转换]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 存储层&#10;        F --&gt; G[Prometheus/Mimir]&#10;        F --&gt; H[Loki/Elasticsearch]&#10;        F --&gt; I[Tempo/Jaeger]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 查询/展示层&#10;        G --&gt; J[Grafana]&#10;        H --&gt; J&#10;        I --&gt; J&#10;        J --&gt; K[仪表盘/告警/探索]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 数据采集层\n        A[应用SDK] --&gt; D[OTel Collector]\n        B[基础设施Agent] --&gt; D\n        C[日志采集器] --&gt; D\n    end\n    subgraph 数据处理层\n        D --&gt; E[路由/过滤/采样]\n        E --&gt; F[格式转换]\n    end\n    subgraph 存储层\n        F --&gt; G[Prometheus/Mimir]\n        F --&gt; H[Loki/Elasticsearch]\n        F --&gt; I[Tempo/Jaeger]\n    end\n    subgraph 查询/展示层\n        G --&gt; J[Grafana]\n        H --&gt; J\n        I --&gt; J\n        J --&gt; K[仪表盘/告警/探索]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台方案</th>\n<th>架构风格</th>\n<th>成本模型</th>\n<th>运维复杂度</th>\n<th>数据控制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Datadog</td>\n<td>SaaS 统一</td>\n<td>按主机+数据量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低（SaaS）</td>\n<td>快速上手/中小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>New Relic</td>\n<td>SaaS 统一</td>\n<td>按数据量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全栈观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grafana Cloud</td>\n<td>SaaS 组合</td>\n<td>按数据量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>OSS偏好/控制成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自建 LGTM Stack</td>\n<td>自托管组合</td>\n<td>基础设施成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大规模/数据合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS CloudWatch</td>\n<td>云原生</td>\n<td>按使用量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>AWS 深度用户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry-采集架构\">OpenTelemetry 采集架构</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）已成为可观测性数据采集的事实标准。OTel 提供了统一的 SDK（生成遥测数据）、Collector（收集和处理遥测数据）和协议（OTLP，传输遥测数据）。采用 OTel 标准意味着应用代码与后端存储解耦——可以在不修改应用代码的情况下切换后端平台。</p>\n<p><strong>OTel Collector 部署模式</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>Agent 模式</strong>：在每个节点上部署一个 Collector 实例（DaemonSet），接收该节点上所有 Pod 的遥测数据。优势是数据在本节点内完成初步处理（采样、过滤），减少网络传输。</p>\n<p><strong>Gateway 模式</strong>：集中部署少量高配置的 Collector 实例（Deployment），所有节点的数据发送到 Gateway 进行统一处理。优势是集中化管理采样策略和数据路由。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐的两层架构</strong>：Agent（节点级采集 + 初步过滤）→ Gateway（集中处理 + 尾部采样 + 路由到后端）。这种架构兼顾了本地化处理的效率和集中化管理的灵活性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"receivers:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    protocols:&#10;      grpc:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317&#10;      http:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318&#10;  prometheus:&#10;    config:&#10;      scrape_configs:&#10;        - job_name: &#39;kubernetes-pods&#39;&#10;          kubernetes_sd_configs:&#10;            - role: pod&#10;&#10;processors:&#10;  batch:&#10;    timeout: 5s&#10;    send_batch_size: 8192&#10;  memory_limiter:&#10;    check_interval: 1s&#10;    limit_mib: 4096&#10;    spike_limit_mib: 512&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    policies:&#10;      - name: errors&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      - name: slow-traces&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 1000 }&#10;      - name: probabilistic&#10;        type: probabilistic&#10;        probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 1 }&#10;&#10;exporters:&#10;  prometheusremotewrite:&#10;    endpoint: &#39;http://mimir:9009/api/v1/push&#39;&#10;  loki:&#10;    endpoint: &#39;http://loki:3100/loki/api/v1/push&#39;&#10;  otlp/tempo:&#10;    endpoint: &#39;tempo:4317&#39;&#10;    tls:&#10;      insecure: true&#10;&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    metrics:&#10;      receivers: [otlp, prometheus]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch]&#10;      exporters: [prometheusremotewrite]&#10;    logs:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch]&#10;      exporters: [loki]&#10;    traces:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, tail_sampling, batch]&#10;      exporters: [otlp/tempo]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4318</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      scrape_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">job_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kubernetes-pods'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          kubernetes_sd_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    send_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    check_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spike_limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">errors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">status_codes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slow-traces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">threshold_ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prometheusremotewrite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://mimir:9009/api/v1/push'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  loki</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://loki:3100/loki/api/v1/push'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tempo:4317'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      insecure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheusremotewrite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">loki</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"存储架构与扩展性\">存储架构与扩展性</h2><p>可观测性数据的存储是平台成本的主要组成部分。不同类型的遥测数据有不同的存储特性和挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>指标存储</strong>：Prometheus 是最流行的指标存储，但单实例不支持水平扩展和长期存储。Grafana Mimir（Cortex 的继任者）和 Thanos 提供了 Prometheus 兼容的分布式长期存储。Mimir 支持全局查询视图（跨多个 Prometheus 实例聚合）、无限期存储（使用对象存储如 S3）和自动降采样。</p>\n<p><strong>日志存储</strong>：Grafana Loki 采用了&quot;只索引标签、不索引日志内容&quot;的架构，将存储成本降低到 Elasticsearch 的 1/10 以下。代价是全文搜索性能较低——Loki 更适合基于标签过滤后的日志查看，而非大规模全文检索。Elasticsearch 仍是全文搜索场景的首选。</p>\n<p><strong>追踪存储</strong>：Grafana Tempo 采用&quot;只存储不索引&quot;的极简架构，将追踪数据直接存储到对象存储（S3/GCS），通过 Trace ID 直接查找。这使得 Tempo 的存储成本极低，但只能通过 Trace ID 检索——不支持&quot;查找所有包含错误的 Trace&quot;这类搜索。TraceQL 通过流式扫描部分解决了搜索需求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储系统</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>存储后端</th>\n<th>索引策略</th>\n<th>成本效率</th>\n<th>查询延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mimir</td>\n<td>指标</td>\n<td>S3 + 本地缓存</td>\n<td>倒排索引</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loki</td>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>S3 + BoltDB</td>\n<td>标签索引</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempo</td>\n<td>追踪</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>无索引</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>按ID低/搜索高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>日志/追踪</td>\n<td>本地磁盘</td>\n<td>全文倒排索引</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多租户与访问控制\">多租户与访问控制</h2><p>企业级可观测性平台通常服务多个团队和业务线，需要多租户隔离和细粒度的访问控制。</p>\n<p><strong>数据隔离</strong>：Mimir、Loki 和 Tempo 都支持多租户模式。每个租户的数据在存储层物理隔离（不同的对象存储路径），查询时通过 HTTP Header 中的 Tenant ID 确定数据范围。这确保了团队 A 无法查询团队 B 的数据。</p>\n<p><strong>Grafana RBAC</strong>（Role-Based Access Control）控制用户对仪表盘、数据源和告警的访问权限。常见的角色层级包括：Viewer（只看仪表盘）、Editor（编辑仪表盘和告警）和 Admin（管理数据源和团队）。组织和文件夹级别的权限控制允许不同团队管理自己的仪表盘空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可观测性平台在统一平台（Datadog/New Relic）和组合式平台（LGTM Stack）之间权衡成本、灵活性和运维复杂度</li>\n<li>OpenTelemetry 是数据采集的事实标准，两层 Collector 架构（Agent + Gateway）兼顾效率和灵活性</li>\n<li>Mimir/Loki/Tempo 分别优化指标/日志/追踪的存储成本，共同使用对象存储（S3）作为长期存储后端</li>\n<li>Loki 不索引日志内容的架构将成本降至 Elasticsearch 的 1/10，但牺牲了全文搜索性能</li>\n<li>多租户通过 Tenant ID 实现数据物理隔离，Grafana RBAC 控制仪表盘和告警的访问权限</li>\n<li>存储成本是平台 TCO 的主要组成部分，降采样和分层存储是控制成本的关键手段</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性平台架构","id":"可观测性平台架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry 采集架构","id":"opentelemetry-采集架构"},{"level":2,"text":"存储架构与扩展性","id":"存储架构与扩展性"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户与访问控制","id":"多租户与访问控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混沌工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/alerting-incident/chaos-engineering"},"next":{"title":"仪表盘与数据可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/observability-platforms/dashboarding"}}